":351206,"en":"When the unbeliever is angry,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l017","ordinal":351207,"en":"Destroying the people, the nation,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l018","ordinal":351208,"en":"When you step on the roof,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l019","ordinal":351209,"en":"Let's cry, cry blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l020","ordinal":351210,"en":"All the people will cry."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l021","ordinal":351211,"en":"He made your people poor,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l022","ordinal":351212,"en":"You really lost your dignity."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l023","ordinal":351213,"en":"The arrival of the son of the monster,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l024","ordinal":351214,"en":"Did a bad trick,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l025","ordinal":351215,"en":"He killed what was hidden."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l026","ordinal":351216,"en":"If it's enough to die, it's dead."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l027","ordinal":351217,"en":"Divide the area into two."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l028","ordinal":351218,"en":"A generous benefactor,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l029","ordinal":351219,"en":"He spewed his venomous spirit,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l030","ordinal":351220,"en":"All brave people"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l031","ordinal":351221,"en":"He was furious,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l032","ordinal":351222,"en":"All the rest of the country,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l033","ordinal":351223,"en":"Again he was disappointed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l034","ordinal":351224,"en":"The people ran and made a noise."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l035","ordinal":351225,"en":"There was a thunderous sound."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l036","ordinal":351226,"en":"The son of a monster is an infidel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l037","ordinal":351227,"en":"He hated what he had to say,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l038","ordinal":351228,"en":"He gnawed at everything."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l039","ordinal":351229,"en":"Thinking with thoughts"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b002:l040","ordinal":351230,"en":"It is Sarybay."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b003:l001","ordinal":351231,"en":"Without leaving offspring,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0733:b003:l002","ordinal":351232,"en":"It's like scraping."}]
